    {
      "id": "claim_e237fe535f464db4994ae882432a8466",
      "statement": "A requested model is validated against the configured allowlist before it reaches the CLI, because the value arrives directly off the WebSocket and an unchecked string would let a caller select any model the credential can reach.",
