      "id": "claim_534873d0b15c4f28a370c4a47ed1a5fb",
      "statement": "Every path through a turn — completion, cancellation or exception — converges on _finish(), which emits exactly one terminal event of interrupted, error or complete, guaranteeing the client's spinner always stops.",
