    {
      "id": "claim_7953acbb190348b8bc23b9a0c3a25219",
      "statement": "ChatConnection.aclose() shuts down in dependency order — denying approvals first, then closing the session, draining persisters, cancelling the heartbeat and flushing the sender — so the SDK is never left waiting on a decision that can no longer arrive.",
